00:04:56.530 --> 00:04:58.490
Close damn shave!

00:04:58.490 --> 00:05:01.070
Hey! Ken's score!

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:03.070
Sakura Airi 55
Sato Maya 53
Sudo Ken 52
Onodera Kayano 50
